There is no single licence for this repository.

Each template directory starts from a different upstream theme, under whatever
terms that theme carries, and bundles fonts under their own. Putting one licence
at the root would misstate all of them.

    midcentury-olive/LICENSE

Look there. Each of those files lists three things separately: the theme and its
author, the additions made here, and the fonts.

The README files, this file, and anything else at the top level of this
repository are under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International.
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

No institution's logo is distributed anywhere in this repository. A trademark is
not covered by a licence on the files around it.
